# Worker: Self-Review

> Operator-requested publication review for a completed Farmslot run.
> Execute the checklist directly. Do not use shortcut review commands.

> Checklist marker: run `temp/tasks/golden/self-review/mark start` once, then `temp/tasks/golden/self-review/mark N`
> after each checklist item. Finish with `temp/tasks/golden/self-review/mark complete --mark-last`.

## Task

```
TASK_DIR: temp/tasks/golden/self-review
REPO: /nonexistent/golden-repo
PLATFORM: cli
WATCHER_PORT: 8061
CDP_PORT: 
SESSION: golden-slot
RUNTIME_DIR: .sandbox/farmslot-farm/agent
TICKET: GOLDEN-SELF-REVIEW
VALIDATION_DEPTH: full-live
```

## Checklist

- [ ] **1. Start** — run `temp/tasks/golden/self-review/mark start` and `temp/tasks/golden/self-review/mark 1`.
- [ ] **2. Read quality rules**:
  ```bash
  cd /nonexistent/golden-repo
  cat .sandbox/farmslot-farm/agent/review-quality.md 2>/dev/null || true
  ```
- [ ] **3. Inspect the worker output**:
  ```bash
  cd /nonexistent/golden-repo
  git diff main...HEAD --stat
  git diff main...HEAD
  cat temp/tasks/golden/self-review/artifacts/pr-description.md 2>/dev/null || true
  cat temp/tasks/golden/self-review/artifacts/recipe-coverage.md 2>/dev/null || true
  cat temp/tasks/golden/self-review/artifacts/recipe-quality.json 2>/dev/null || true
  ```
- [ ] **4. Run focused validation** - prefer the worker-recorded commands. For command-center changes, run:
  ```bash
  cd /nonexistent/golden-repo/apps/command-center && yarn typecheck
  ```
  Then run changed tests listed in the worker report or visible in the diff.
- [ ] **5. Audit evidence**:
  ```bash
  cd /nonexistent/golden-repo
  node <FARMSLOT_ROOT>/scripts/quality/check-task-artifact-contract.mjs temp/tasks/golden/self-review --require-recipe-coverage-if-recipe
  ```
  If screenshots are present, inspect whether the claimed UI state is actually visible.
- [ ] **6. Judge the change** - check correctness, minimality, test coverage, recipe quality, evidence quality, and whether any introduced issue should block publishing.
- [ ] **7. Write `temp/tasks/golden/self-review/artifacts/review-feedback.md`**:
  ```markdown
  # Self-Review: GOLDEN-SELF-REVIEW

  ## Verdict: PASS

  ## Summary
  <brief summary of what changed and whether it is correct>

  ## Validation
  - <commands run and result>

  ## Evidence
  - <artifact/evidence assessment>

  ## Issues
  - <empty for PASS, or file:line findings for ISSUES>
  ```
  Use `## Verdict: ISSUES` when any blocking issue or cheap introduced nit remains.
- [ ] **8. Complete** - run:
  ```bash
  temp/tasks/golden/self-review/mark complete --mark-last
  ```

